Depending on their type, it may:
- Stun briefly.
- Interrupt an attack.
- Push back.
- Disable a shield.
- Open an environmental route.

Not every enemy must behave identically.

Do not make Wake instantly defeat every enemy.

Do not add a conventional weapon system unless
